OL,6,G1800 I'm a Celebrity - How to Survive
OL,7,G     the Jungle
OL,8,     FAnt and Dec present hints and
OL,9,     Ftongue-in-cheek tips for
OL,10,     Fcelebrities to help survive not
OL,11,     Fonly the jungle and camp life, but
OL,12,     Falso campmates and their
OL,13,     Fassortment of annoying habits.
OL,14,     FThey also revisit some of the most
OL,15,     Fmemorable moments in the
OL,16,     Fprogramme's history, drawing on a
OL,17,     Fquarter of a century of terrifying
OL,18,     Ftrials and camp chaos to arm the
OL,19,     Fnext bunch of unsuspecting
OL,20,     Fcelebrities with an arsenal of
OL,21,     Fmust-have jungle hacks
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/6
